# Gate step 1941-rlim — a provider usage limit is reported as itself, ends the
# lane with a distinct verdict (exit 75), records its deadline, and a launch
# before the deadline refuses without calling the provider. Drives
# images/default/lib-provider-limit.sh and the real harness-supervisor with
# the RECORDED 2026-11-01 lines (Retry-After 78443, "Free usage limit
# reached"); the night's EPROTO line is the negative control. No network.
#
